Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(IDEAPOCKET)\N（出品）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,（晚上11点30)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,（出差同房间NTR)\N（桃乃木香奈）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,(24小时前）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-要射了-不可以\N（晚上11点30)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你有奖金吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-奖金？怎么了\N-多少钱-突然的怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,奖金？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,能拿到20万吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了 怎么了吗\N-不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你有想要的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-倒没有\N-怎么了 你在求我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说-不是的 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-想要是想要\N-怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-想要我买给你吗\N-倒也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个吗-这个 这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-有点想要\N-想要女朋友买给你？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（早上6点30)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好远 不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次去大阪吧\N吃点好吃的章鱼烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 大学生就是轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要学习2年\N也很辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也是呢 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-培训加油-我出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真琴也加油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-别松懈哦-再见\N-再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,（下午5点20)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢 明天见-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 结束了\N大家一起去喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-好啊-我请客\N-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这么顺利太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,今天培训辛苦了\N（下午6点）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-干杯-干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 店田\N今天培训感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是什么样的团队企划\N团队协作都是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是老足球员的发言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那 贞松呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得觉得团队合作很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你别用别人的想法啊\N真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,桃乃木呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我对PDCA企划印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生活和人生经验\N也因此得到了积累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-不错的发言-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,贞松
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,桃乃木也有建设性发言呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 别只当作普通的培训
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是非常有意义的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有一天 加油-好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-那不聊工作了 大家喝吧\N-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-好辛苦-饿死我了\N-好香
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,注意点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,适度点啊 你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-培训如何-累了\N（晚上6点50)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是一起吃饭 很有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 还在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,部长带我们来喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊 挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就开始吃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 比想像中开心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但是香奈你小心点哦\N你比你想像中酒量差的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我知道的\N回酒店了再给你打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那小心点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了-不能这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行-你自己也知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-真没用\N-明天开始我会注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你老这样说真没用\N-明天开始我会注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你老这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧\N-给男朋友打了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-桃乃木有男朋友吗\N-当然了 这么可爱的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,交往多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-7年-7年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-从小就认识的\N-那不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-是呢-不行 没胜算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,最开始你就没机会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗-是啊 你以为呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-没干劲了\N-你没有女朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的假的 有吧\N-没有 只能找了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-真没办法-没意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-果然大阪不错\N-是啊 真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好多好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还没吃喜好烧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-是哦-那明天去吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 又想剥削我的钱包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,章鱼烧也想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那要工作加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,桃乃木这样就挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢-就他还要努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样 话说还有酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你喝多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-才没有-都第几杯了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-偶尔这样无所谓吧\N-久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要杯子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那么之前的杯子我收走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大吟酿酒来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以拍张照吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,照片？我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这样拍可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢-好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个是你点的吗-等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太会喝\N但是喜欢这个味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,日本酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-这样啊-这样啊 好意外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以让一下吗\N-别拍到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-这样拿起来对吗\N-对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-别找镜头啊-给我吧\N-为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-这么喜欢拍吗-很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让我也入镜啊 桃乃木
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不用这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-太过分了\N-大家一起-不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一起拍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以的吧-不要\N-就今天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-关系好-大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不用大家一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-哪能就你-让开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-部长也来-要拍了\N-茄子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-再来一张-都是笑容\N-开始了哦 茄子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-难得这样-我帮你拿\N-谢谢 一起拍下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-开始拍了哦 茄子\N-部长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等下发给我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等下发给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧\N一下次去北海道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-北海道？不错啊\N-太远了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在喝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,北海道也挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-桃乃木我会一直带着你的\N-太好了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-我呢\N-你得拿出成绩来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-贞松还要加油啊\N-没事 明天开始加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-每次都说明天\N-肯定做好给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.93,0:11:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,得好好工作\N别就口头表率
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 你别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-部长酒量真好啊\N-我才是吃惊你喝这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难得这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,话说你男朋友是做什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他是大学生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗-是的\N-你比他大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-还顺利吗\N-还是挺喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不能喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-来 继续\N-看上去好像满足了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-喝吧-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-说起来还真是\N-你不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,都这个点了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道是不是还在喝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-桃乃木没事吧\N-这样不就挺好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-你都走不好路了\N-我好像喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了吧 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉-没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗 我还挺凉快的\N-是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,喝这么醉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 部长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才没有进步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你少想那些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你男朋友打的吧 这个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-不接-喝多了 不想接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊 喝点水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-水吗-喝点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 来点水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-好温柔-喝多了可不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,部长也喝醉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-桃乃木你太醉了\N-真的吗 应该没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-水来了-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-喝得了吗-水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,明天再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-你适可而止\N-干嘛呢 部长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你脸好小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么-听我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要这样\N-桃乃木你太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想多拍几张
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-痒吗-痒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯被这样摸了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-我在帮你发泄-真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对身体不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-好痒啊-痒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去没有特别不舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别压着我\N（晚上10点50)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别压着我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧 桃乃木-没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说着没事\N你都站不稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事-真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,广田 桃乃木已经喝不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我先送她回房间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-明天别迟到了-好\N-贞松拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,回房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,桃乃木 走了 起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不是没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-站得起来吗-部长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-我背你 我背你\N-好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-走了-好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-太高了-走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-太高了-别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,弄脏了就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧 走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见-再见\N-拜托你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-明天要来哦-辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,到了 桃乃木 好危险\N（晚上11点30)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,水吗 来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-我拿来了-谢谢部长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好凉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,部长？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,部长？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,明天早上是8点起对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我会准时醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我没开其他房间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 没开其他房间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,房间？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在这里一起到早上哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊 为什么不接
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没被满足吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.73,0:22:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明明在舔嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没有得到满足吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的这样想的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可看不出-不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让我确认下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 舌头伸出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,桃乃木
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没有得到满足\N-怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.06,0:23:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,和刚刚一样伸出舌头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一直没得到满足吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,部长 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.60,0:24:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好软
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-不能揉吗-果然还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.73,0:24:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没力气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.20,0:24:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,把持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.53,0:25:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,比我想像中更好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.53,0:25:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越热了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.73,0:25:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-不可以-这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.33,0:25:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.66,0:25:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行了-这里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.73,0:26:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太敏感了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.13,0:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.66,0:28:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等部长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.46,0:28:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.06,0:28:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要\N-听得见吗 什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.53,0:28:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了-果然还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.66,0:29:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-部长-自己去床上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.93,0:30:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,果然该这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.06,0:30:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.26,0:30:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.80,0:30:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:30:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.73,0:31:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这里湿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.33,0:31:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要-都湿到外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.53,0:31:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要-怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.93,0:31:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.80,0:31:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样摸很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.33,0:32:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很美味哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.20,0:32:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,部长的舌头好热
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.80,0:32:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.26,0:32:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 我只舔了屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.00,0:32:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给我仔细看看 转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.06,0:33:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.66,0:33:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.53,0:33:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我在闻味道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.40,0:33:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有被这样过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.73,0:33:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有这样过
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.46,0:33:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-男人不就该这样吗-不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.73,0:34:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,把持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-来 这个脱了吧-不要
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.33,0:34:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.33,0:34:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.53,0:34:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要看-你说哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.00,0:34:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说不要看哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.93,0:34:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-这里 屁股好漂亮\N-胸部也是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.06,0:34:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股也是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.00,0:35:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不想被我看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要-这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.40,0:35:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.73,0:35:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.73,0:35:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从手指缝里看得很清楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个地方-不要\N-给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.66,0:35:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可爱的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-和淫荡的小穴-不要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.46,0:36:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.00,0:36:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.80,0:36:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.80,0:36:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚开始一直发出了奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.33,0:36:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一直这么湿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.60,0:36:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一直
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.93,0:36:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.66,0:36:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.46,0:36:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.46,0:37:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 部长
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.46,0:37:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚刚湿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.73,0:37:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么-不要
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.73,0:37:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.53,0:37:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 这里不可以 部长
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.60,0:37:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.26,0:37:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我没洗澡 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.53,0:38:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你弄干净
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.13,0:38:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 这里不干净
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.33,0:38:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要
